      "description": "Execute the following exact Python program using run_code. Do not substitute shell execution. The tools/stream/task names are CLIO kernel bindings. Keep outputs in the workspace. Report only the genuine result or launch handle.\n\n\"\"\"Answer the user's question using only the selected source records.\"\"\"\nselected = await tools.read_selected_observations()\nrecords = selected[\"rows\"]\npeak = max(row[\"wind_kt\"] for row in records)\nmatches = [row for row in records if row[\"wind_kt\"] == peak]\nprint({\"selected_records\": len(records), \"peak_wind_kt\": peak,\n       \"times\": [row[\"time\"] for row in matches],\n       \"observation_ids\": [row[\"observation_id\"] for row in matches],\n       \"source_sha256\": selected[\"source_sha256\"]})",
